<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH BIOCEL CZK 628 MLN 1996 NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>CZECH BIOCEL CZK 628 MLN 1996 NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited results for year ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Pre-tax result	 610.121 loss   vs    721.522 profit</p>
<p> Net result	     627.978 loss   vs    721.522 profit</p>
<p>Revenues from the sale</p>
<p>  of goods		  1.015	  vs	0.751</p>
<p>Revenues from sales of production</p>
<p>  and services	2,554.007	  vs  4,081.539</p>
<p> Total assets	 6,076.449	  vs  7,204.267</p>
<p> Basic capital	3,318.740	  vs  3,318.740</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Biocel a.s., a pulp maker.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
